Third-party components

The reporting framework in `trellum/` bundles front-end libraries and depends
on Python packages that carry their own licences. They are audited and listed
in `trellum/THIRD-PARTY.md`, which distinguishes:

  - BUNDLED components, whose code ships inside built reports
    (`trellum/static/vendor/`), and
  - DEPENDED-UPON packages, installed from PyPI at build time.

The control plane's own runtime dependencies are pinned in
`requirements-django.txt`. A CycloneDX and an SPDX SBOM are generated for every
released image and published alongside it, signed with the release; see
`.github/workflows/release.yml`.

All third-party components remain under the licences granted by their
respective authors. Nothing in this NOTICE modifies them.

